# Note the bug being regression tested against (MOCO-4232) required us to
# precompile a package relative to the current working directory, leaving us
# with an "empty" working directory. We'd then fail to search there for
# modules, meaning we'd not find the package when it was being renamed at the
# same time.
# Thus we copy the package into the test's execution directory, meaning we can
# use relative pathing for it.

# RUN: mkdir -p %t
# RUN: cp -r %S/test_package %t
# RUN: mojo precompile test_package -o rename.mojoc
